{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvRKpSEowCBwnU8Mfjr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi'le, I mean, my son, listen. I didn't decide anything. I'll ask you first, and maybe the bank too. The page says the cheapest place to keep it is **\"פסגות ניירות ערך בע\"מ\"**. The only fund name I saw was **\"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\"**. Putting in 10,000 ₪ at the start and 500 ₪ a month, I'd have **86,045 ₪** after ten years. I'm not sure about any of it. That number assumes \"7%\" a year, and I didn't choose the 7%, it was already in the box. Leumi, which I know, came out 82,968 ₪.\n\n**What I looked at:**\n1. **Screen 1.** The heading was \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". Then a lot of English: MSCI, S&P 500, נאסד\"ק. I nearly left. \"ת\"א-125\" was already marked, so I carried on. The boxes said \"סכום היום\" 10,000 and \"הפקדה חודשית\" 500. I didn't touch the sliders.\n2. **Screen 2.** \"תשואה בשנה 7%\". Then \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\". Under \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול\" it said 86,045 ₪, \"נשאר לכם בעוד 10 שנים, אחרי דמי ניהול ומס, בכסף של היום\". Next to it was \"-1,030 ₪\" with a minus sign, and that frightened me a bit.\n3. **Screen 3.** A coloured bar with words under it: \"דמי משמרת\", \"עמלות קנייה ומכירה\", \"מס\". Then פסגות, which takes 1,049 ₪ over 10 years. Under that it says \"כשקונים בהם את אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\".\n4. **Screens 4 to 6.** A list of banks and how much each leaves you:\n   - Leumi 82,968\n   - Hapoalim 81,052\n   - Discount 79,491\n   - Mizrahi I didn't see\n   - At the bottom, אלטשולר and מיטב came out around 63,000, with big red bars.\n\n   After that list I was tired, so I stopped. I didn't get to screens 7 to 13.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"מדד\" here isn't the price index from the news. Also \"מחקה\", \"4A\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"בכסף של היום\", the \"-1,030\", the \"★\", the dotted purple lines under the numbers, and \"לא בחישוב\". The coloured bars I didn't try to read. Orange and yellow look almost the same to me.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- White on black is hard on my eyes. The grey text, like \"הבחירה שלכם; האתר לא ממליץ על מדד\", I could hardly read.\n- So many numbers and red bars. It's shares, not a deposit, and if it falls, it falls.\n- I don't know who \"מקור\" is.\n- Where's the fund I'm supposed to buy? I saw only one name, in small letters."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3761,"cache_read_input_tokens":11666,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3761},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2a6c13a-f4c5-4d5c-a7a7-019ed67c5521","uuid":"4b8569b5-afb7-4fa4-942f-4a15f76a93bc","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:56:12.539Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvRKcHPuwpMXShWgRb3"}
